%S A401141 3,7,13,5,13,71,11,71,13,13,41,17,5,41,11,17,5,7,5,13,59,151,7,17,199,
%T A401141 17,7,109,103,59,311,103,107,19,7,61,13,239,13,433,421,137,29,227,269,
%U A401141 13,59,7,179,197,17,11,13,349,29,101,13,61,31,11,521,19,101,71
%N A401141 a(n) = the first twin-prime in the earliest chain of 2n-1 consecutive twin-primes whose sum is a twin-prime.
%e A401141 3 is the first twin-prime in the chain [3], which is the earliest chain of 2 * 1 - 1 = 1 consecutive twin-primes whose sum, 3, is a twin-prime. Hence a(1) = 3.
%e A401141 7 is the first twin-prime in the chain [7, 11, 13], which is the earliest chain of 2 * 2 - 1 = 3 consecutive twin-primes whose sum, 31, is a twin-prime. Hence a(2) = 7.
